{"name": "GRAVHOUNDS", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GRAVHOUNDS is a 1\u20134 player co-op action builder. Drop into hostile planets as a pack, build and defend your base in physics-driven mayhem, and extract with everything you can carry before you become alien chow! The longer you stay, the greater the danger... and the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"57\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/57756b6a5313e8159dac2a24074d41bd.webp?t=1787727490\" width=\"617\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.poster.avif?t=1787727490\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.webm?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.mp4?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense alone, chaotic with a crew. Combine each Gravhound's strengths and improvise to beat back the swarm. Go lone wolf to expand the operation or stick with the pack and stand your ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"57\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/7124ada6192ef454199e5470d40ba322.webp?t=1787727490\" width=\"617\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.poster.avif?t=1787727490\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.webm?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.mp4?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fetch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fling objects across the battlefield to your teammates. Turn gravity against the swarm and send them flying, one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disclaimer: Transporting volatile materials with the Grav Beam may result in unforeseen loss of Gravhounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"57\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/da990cfae570221a451d01475fc26a5d.webp?t=1787727490\" width=\"617\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.poster.avif?t=1787727490\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.webm?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.mp4?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy turrets, generators, and fabricators to expand the operation and defend it from the swarm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extend pipelines across hostile terrain to power your base, move resources, and keep your escape route alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"57\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/bdfd7245fdbad0997d0aba6e1247fe79.webp?t=1787727490\" width=\"617\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.poster.avif?t=1787727490\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.webm?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.mp4?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a crew of bio-engineered canine workers built for dangerous planetary operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loyal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obedient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expendable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"57\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/dc18a33eef7f4fbe1c9f2ac502bdbb29.webp?t=1787727490\" width=\"617\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/8873c2aaf34c5bc7a553a03b98cbd226.poster.avif?t=1787727490\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/8873c2aaf34c5bc7a553a03b98cbd226.webm?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/8873c2aaf34c5bc7a553a03b98cbd226.mp4?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful new abilities and upgrades mid-shift. Stack bonuses and reshape your loadout to suit the situation. The swarm grows deadlier by the second - but so do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"57\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/5b1fe41d3de3932509cf8e9f62e06945.webp?t=1787727490\" width=\"617\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c24c87bcd26c6655cd2ef83c9ed50b24.poster.avif?t=1787727490\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c24c87bcd26c6655cd2ef83c9ed50b24.webm?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/c24c87bcd26c6655cd2ef83c9ed50b24.mp4?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boost in any direction and reposition under fire. Race to your teammates' aid or make a last dash for materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warning: Unauthorized recreational use of pipeline boost is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"57\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/a1dd2922565c9625f3b71bd5ac403f84.webp?t=1787727490\" width=\"617\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.poster.avif?t=1787727490\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.webm?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.mp4?t=1787727490\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek out treacherous planets for the best materials - the higher the risk, the greater the rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new Gravhounds, weapons, and upgrade paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay longer, push harder, and the swarm escalates. Every shift becomes a bet on how much your pack can handle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"57\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/extras/830f3f8e04099b85a275e9f81484331a.webp?t=1787727490\" width=\"617\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Far from home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swarm closing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still expected to hit quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get to work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "GRAVHOUNDS is a 1\u20134 player co-op action builder. Drop into hostile planets as a pack, build and defend your base in physics-driven mayhem, and extract with everything you can carry before you become alien chow! The longer you stay, the greater the danger... and the rewards.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440760/2432c78a467c370bcfa566baa22f0939df5219b0/header.jpg?t=1787727490", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Online Co-Op", "PvE", "Shooter", "Action Roguelike", "Third-Person Shooter", "Third Person"], "developers": "Octopus Panic, Inc.", "publishers": "Octopus Panic, Inc.", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2440760", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "25 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0BqZpGRFCQU", "first_seen": 1787616000.0}